Package: adaptation-xiaomi-picasso
Version: 1.6.1
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Minh Tri <minhtritt1996@gmail.com>
Depends: adaptation-android-generic, phosh, phoc
Replaces: libwlroots12a, getcutout
Provides: adaptation-device
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Hardware adaptation package for Xiaomi Redmi K30 5G (picasso)
 Provides GPU patch, hardware acceleration, panel backlight service (50% default),
 direct phosh launcher, Wi-Fi bringup (signed in-tree wlan.ko) with safe
 boot-time auto-connect (post-bringup, race-free),
 display power initializer, ALSA audio, 60Hz/120Hz display switcher,
 camera/torch rules, boot-completed signalling, auto-rotation,
 hardware Qualcomm MSM watchdog bite on hang/panic, hung-task detection,
 PMIC watchdog real-time guardian, 24/24 server mode, and stabilized Waydroid integration.

